PathChord installs a loopback-only default Ingress configuration at
%%PREFIX%%/etc/pathchord/ingress/ingress.yaml and creates a pathchord service account.

Enable the local listener in /etc/rc.conf:

  pathchord_ingressd_enable="YES"

The Egress service is disabled by default. Provision an identity and enable
it only after replacing the example values in /etc/rc.conf:

  pathchord_egressd_enable="YES"
  pathchord_egressd_id="exit"
  pathchord_egressd_bind="0.0.0.0:7443"
  pathchord_egressd_identity="/var/db/pathchord-egress/egress.key.json"

The package includes the pathchordctl(1) manual and rc.d service definitions.
